---
{
  "access": "destructive",
  "auth_modes": [],
  "body": "Json",
  "description": "Only the most recent payment is refunded, and only once; the subscription stays valid and keeps renewing. In the sandbox and for products priced 0 the refund completes at once. Other payments are refunded only through Huawei support.\n\nDestructive: refunds the user's latest subscription payment; this cannot be undone.\n\nApp secret: this HMS In-App Purchases server API is not part of the AppGallery Connect API. The server signs the request with an app-level access token of the app given in `appId`, obtained with the stored app secret of that app, not with its API client. The user stores the app secret with `appgallery-connect-mcp auth app-secret set`. `api_request` cannot call this operation.",
  "group": "subscriptions",
  "input_schema": {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "appId": {
        "description": "App ID of the app whose app secret signs this request (My apps > the app > App information). It selects the stored app secret and is not sent to Huawei.",
        "pattern": "^[0-9]{1,20}$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "body": {
        "description": "Request body: `IapSubscriptionRequest` object. Purchase of a subscription.",
        "properties": {
          "purchaseToken": {
            "description": "Purchase token from the purchase data (InAppPurchaseData) that the IAP client returns after a purchase or a purchase query.",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "subscriptionId": {
            "description": "Subscription ID (subscriptionId of the purchase data).",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "subscriptionId",
          "purchaseToken"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "appId",
      "body"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
